WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.378 --> 00:00:06.381
Hold your breath
while we're on the bridge.

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:09.676
Even a tiny breath

00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:12.804
will break the spell
and the attendants will see you.

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:19.394
I'm scared.

00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:20.937
Be calm.

00:00:21.062 --> 00:00:24.232
Welcome. Always nice to see you.

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:26.443
Welcome.

00:00:26.943 --> 00:00:28.111
I'm back from my task.

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:29.946
Welcome back, sir.

00:00:31.239 --> 00:00:32.991
A deep breath...

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:35.243
And hold...

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:55.847
Welcome back! We missed you!

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.933
Hang on, we're almost...

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:01.436
Master Haku.

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:03.813
Where have you...

00:01:05.315 --> 00:01:07.025
Wha... A human.

00:01:07.984 --> 00:01:09.152
Run.

00:01:11.279 --> 00:01:12.822
What...

